* cell full_adder
* pin VDD
* pin VMID
* pin VSS
* pin a
* pin b
* pin cin
* pin cout
* pin sum
.SUBCKT full_adder VDD VMID VSS a b cin cout sum
* cell instance $1 r0 *1 1468.45,-98.25
X$1 VDD \$1 cout VSS inverter
* cell instance $2 r0 *1 1312,-98.25
X$2 VDD \$1 VMID \$12 \$8 VSS nany
* cell instance $4 r0 *1 -96.05,-98.25
X$4 \$12 VMID VDD \$13 a b VSS half_adder
* cell instance $5 r0 *1 600.9,-98.25
X$5 \$8 VMID VDD sum \$13 cin VSS half_adder
.ENDS full_adder

* cell half_adder
